t or multi-sector infrastructure project for the last ten years. 3. Experience working in the field of consulting services on topics related to sustainable city infrastructure, nature-based solutions, climate change, and/or biodiversity (experience in water supply, wastewater management, and/or sustainable landscapes is an advantage). 4. Experience in Indonesia and/or comparable urban contexts (Balikpapan experience is an advantage).', 0, 'low', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2515720);
