opment of Environmental & Social Impact Assessment (ESIA) of integrated area development at least three projects for the last ten years. 3. Experience working in the field of consulting services on topics related to sustainable city infrastructure, nature-based solutions, climate change, and/or biodiversity (experience in fields of mangrove rehabilitation, and circular waste management). 4. Experience in Indonesia and/or comparable urban contexts (Jakarta experience is an advantage).', 0, 'low', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2516653);
